%% Diagram: Bounded Debugging Workflow
%% ID: HARNESS-D19 | Version: 0.1 | State: Target proposal, not automated
flowchart TD
  failure["Observed failure"] --> reproduce["Capture inputs, command, exit code and baseline"]
  reproduce --> scope["Find smallest relevant files and dependency path"]
  scope --> hypothesis["State one falsifiable root-cause hypothesis"]
  hypothesis --> change["Make one minimal, reversible change"]
  change --> tests["Run focused and regression checks"]
  tests --> result{"Passes?"}
  result -->|Yes| review["Independent review and evidence update"]
  result -->|"No; retries remain"| hypothesis
  result -->|Limit reached| blocked["Stop with BLOCKED status and evidence"]
